  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Renewing the Church-State Partnership for Catholic Education (2020), published by Peter Lang Verlag, has been cited 4 times.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Renewing the Church-State Partnership for Catholic Education by Margaret Buck was published by Peter Lang Verlag in 2020. Conceptually, the work connects to General partnership, State (computer science), Political science, Public administration and Sociology.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records 4 citations. Citations peaked in 2020 with 1 citing works. Notable citing venues include Religions, Journal of Religious Education and Catholic education globally. The citing works include 2 journal articles and 2 book chapters. The citing authors are based in the United Kingdom.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It is recorded in 4 library collections.</p>",
